## Quick Reference

| Issue | Quick Fix |
|-------|-----------|
| FSM ID: None | Replace SDK + copy missing modules |
| Error code 3102 | SDK RPC bug - need working SDK version |
| crc_amd64.so missing | Copy utils/lib directory |
| LiDAR bind failed | Update livox_mid.json with your PC IP |
| Changes lost after restart | Run `docker commit` |
